  "ruleText": "Spe 301.06 “National examination in speech-language pathology” means the speech-language pathology examination that is part of the Praxis series administered by the Educational Testing Service located in Princeton, New Jersey.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Spe 300) #9125, eff 4-5-08; ss by #10906, eff 8-7-15",
